    "title": "Supporting families after the loss of a loved one",
    "excerpt": "<p>The loss of a loved one is one of the most vulnerable times in people’s lives. They’re navigating grief while making decisions like: “There are so many choices you have to make,” says Gina Sanchez, Chief of the Cemetery and Funeral Bureau (CFB). “Costs can quickly add up. It can be overwhelming at a time &#8230; <a title=\"Supporting families after the loss of a loved one\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://live-digital-ca-gov.pantheonsite.io/2026/10/07/supporting-families-after-loss-loved-one/\" aria-label=\"More on Supporting families after the loss of a loved one\">Read more</a></p>\n",
